Hmm.  Good point, but perhaps the 'jug' code could be made such that
when you first find a jug, it can only have, say, 1 or 2 swigs in it.
It could be coded similar to bags so that when you put a potion in it,
it fills up the bag by one more potion.  Perhaps one could find a
'blessed' jug which weighs as much as 1 potion, but can hold up the
max allowed (something like 10 potions).

Too make things quite a bit more complex, one could mix potions by
putting several different kinds in the jug.  If you had 3 potions of
invisibity, 2 potions of blindness, and a potion of hallucination (I
don't know why one would do this, but just for the point...), then you
would recieve the effects of parts of each of the potions...what you'd
probably end up with all of the above though is sick :-)  Just a
thought...I'd doubt we'd ever get anything like this...

